# The Phase 3C code identity is bound by sha256 in
# docs/review/mr002/phase3bc/MR002_Phase3C_ExecutableIdentityAndQualification_v1.0.json.
# core.autocrlf would rewrite these files to CRLF on checkout and the bound identity would stop
# reproducing, so LF is pinned in the working tree as well as in the blob.
* text eol=lf
